            LightProfile("hands", "6秒以内に第1記憶（通常攻撃）を敵に3回命中させると、予告を出し、0.30秒後に、前方-25°から+25°へ0.8秒間なぎ払う長さ5m×幅0.6mの光線を放つ。光線は敵1体につき1回、攻撃力・魔力の高い方の30%の光属性ダメージを与える。再発動まで6秒かかる。", "After your basic attack (first memory) hits enemies 3 times within 6 seconds, fire a sweeping beam after a 0.30-second warning. The beam is 5m long and 0.6m wide, and sweeps from -25° to +25° in front of you over 0.8 seconds. It deals Light damage equal to 30% of whichever is higher: your Attack or Ability Power, once per enemy. Cooldown: 6 seconds.", "6秒内第1记忆（通常攻击）命中敌人3次后，显示预警，0.30秒后射出长5m×宽0.6m的光线，在前方从-25°到+25°以0.8秒横扫。光线对每名敌人命中1次，造成相当于攻击力与法术强度中较高一方30%的光属性伤害。冷却6秒。",
                new[] { C("LightBeamBarrage",BossLightBalance.LightBeamBarrageValue,BossLightBalance.LightBeamBarrageCap) },
                new BossAction(BossEvent.MainHit,BossMechanism.ShapeAttack,BossPayload.Damage,"LightBeamBarrage",BossShape.Line,cooldownMillis:BossLightBalance.HandsA0CooldownMillis,delayMillis:BossLightBalance.HandsA0DelayMillis,lifetimeMillis:BossLightBalance.HandsA0LifetimeMillis,mainHits:BossLightBalance.HandsA0MainHits,counterLifetimeMillis:BossLightBalance.HandsA0CounterLifetimeMillis,maxTargets:BossLightBalance.HandsA0MaxTargets,maxInstances:BossLightBalance.HandsA0MaxInstances,rangeMilli:BossLightBalance.HandsA0RangeMilli,widthMilli:BossLightBalance.HandsA0WidthMilli,angleMilli:BossLightBalance.HandsA0AngleMilli,element:BossElement.Light)),
            LightProfile("feet", "第3記憶（移動記憶）による移動が終わったとき、移動方向とその左右20°の計3方向へ予告を出し、0.25秒後に長さ4m×幅0.5mの光線を放って、それぞれ攻撃力・魔力の高い方の8%の光属性ダメージを与える。同じ対象への合計ダメージは攻撃力・魔力の高い方の24%までで、再発動まで5秒かかる。", "When movement from your third memory (movement memory) ends, fire 3 beams after a 0.25-second warning: one in your movement direction and one 20° to either side. Each beam is 4m long and 0.5m wide, and deals Light damage equal to 8% of whichever is higher: your Attack or Ability Power. Total damage to a single target is capped at 24% of whichever is higher: your Attack or Ability Power. Cooldown: 5 seconds.", "第3记忆（移动记忆）的移动结束时，向移动方向及其左右20°共3个方向显示预警，0.25秒后射出长4m×宽0.5m的光线，各造成相当于攻击力与法术强度中较高一方8%的光属性伤害。对同一目标的合计伤害上限为攻击力与法术强度中较高一方的24%，冷却5秒。",
                new[] { C("LightFlashBeams",BossLightBalance.LightFlashBeamsValue,BossLightBalance.LightFlashBeamsCap) }, LightBeam(BossEvent.MovementCompleted,"LightFlashBeams",BossLightBalance.FeetA0CooldownMillis,BossLightBalance.FeetA0DelayMillis,BossLightBalance.FeetA0RangeMilli,BossLightBalance.FeetA0WidthMilli,count:BossLightBalance.FeetA0Count,angle:BossLightBalance.FeetA0AngleMilli)),
            LightProfile("stage2", "第1記憶が命中するか第2記憶を使ったとき、「光相」を1つ得る。光相は最大3スタックで、6秒間持続する。3スタックの状態で、再発動できるときに次の第1記憶を命中させるか第2記憶を使うと、全て消費して、敵またはカーソルの方向へ予告を出し、0.35秒後に長さ8m×幅1mの光線を放って、攻撃力・魔力の高い方の35%の光属性ダメージを与える。再発動まで4秒かかる。", "When your first memory hits or you use your second memory, gain 1 Light Phase stack, up to 3, lasting 6 seconds. With 3 stacks and this effect off cooldown, your next first-memory hit or second-memory use consumes all stacks. After a 0.35-second warning, fire a beam 8m long and 1m wide toward the enemy or cursor, dealing Light damage equal to 35% of whichever is higher: your Attack or Ability Power. Cooldown: 4 seconds.", "第1记忆命中或使用第2记忆时，获得1层“光相”。“光相”最多3层，持续6秒。持有3层且该效果不在冷却时，下一次第1记忆命中或使用第2记忆会消耗全部层数，向敌人或光标方向显示预警，0.35秒后射出长8m×宽1m的光线，造成相当于攻击力与法术强度中较高一方35%的光属性伤害。冷却4秒。",
                new[] { C("LightChargedBeam",BossLightBalance.LightChargedBeamValue,BossLightBalance.LightChargedBeamCap) }, LightBeam(BossEvent.MainHit,"LightChargedBeam",BossLightBalance.Stage2A0CooldownMillis,BossLightBalance.Stage2A0DelayMillis,BossLightBalance.Stage2A0RangeMilli,BossLightBalance.Stage2A0WidthMilli),
                new BossAction(BossEvent.MemoryUse,BossMechanism.Ledger,BossPayload.Mark,lifetimeMillis:BossLightBalance.Stage2A1LifetimeMillis,count:BossLightBalance.Stage2A1Count,maxTargets:BossLightBalance.Stage2A1MaxTargets,maxInstances:BossLightBalance.Stage2A1MaxInstances)),
            LightProfile("stage3", "2セット効果の光線の着弾地点（終端）に予告を出し、0.65秒後に半径1.8mの落雷を落として、攻撃力・魔力の高い方の30%の光属性ダメージを与える。同時に予約できるのは1回までである。", "At the endpoint of the 2-piece set effect's beam, call down lightning after a 0.65-second warning, dealing Light damage equal to 30% of whichever is higher: your Attack or Ability Power, in a 1.8m radius. Only 1 strike can be waiting to occur at a time.", "在2件套效果光线的落点（末端）显示预警，0.65秒后降下半径1.8m的落雷，造成相当于攻击力与法术强度中较高一方30%的光属性伤害。同时最多只能预约1次。",
                new[] { C("LightTerminalLightning",BossLightBalance.LightTerminalLightningValue,BossLightBalance.LightTerminalLightningCap) },
                new BossAction(BossEvent.Clock,BossMechanism.ShapeAttack,BossPayload.Damage,"LightTerminalLightning",delayMillis:BossLightBalance.Stage3A0DelayMillis,maxTargets:BossLightBalance.Stage3A0MaxTargets,maxInstances:BossLightBalance.Stage3A0MaxInstances,radiusMilli:BossLightBalance.Stage3A0RadiusMilli,element:BossElement.Light)),
            LightProfile("stage6", "2セット効果が発動した後、自身の位置から予告を出し、0.3秒後に、長さ6m×幅0.7mの光線で-45°から-15°、-15°から+15°、+15°から+45°の3区画を順に各0.4秒間なぎ払う。各なぎ払いで敵1体につき1回、攻撃力・魔力の高い方の30%の光属性ダメージ（合計90%、上限100%）を与える。さらに既存の光晶を消去して、攻撃能力のない支援光晶を2個生成し（持続3秒）、自身は攻撃力・魔力の高い方の38%（上限40%）の障壁を2秒間得る。障壁は重ならない。再発動まで12秒かかり、光晶は全体で最大2個までである。", "After the 2-piece set effect activates, fire a sweeping beam from your position after a 0.3-second warning. The beam is 6m long and 0.7m wide, and sweeps three sections in order: -45° to -15°, -15° to +15°, and +15° to +45°, taking 0.4 seconds per section. Each sweep deals Light damage equal to 30% of whichever is higher: your Attack or Ability Power, once per enemy (90% total; cap: 100%). Also remove existing light crystals and create 2 support light crystals that last 3 seconds and cannot attack. Gain a non-stacking shield equal to 38% of whichever is higher: your Attack or Ability Power (cap: 40%), for 2 seconds. No more than 2 light crystals can exist in total. Cooldown: 12 seconds.", "2件套效果发动后，从自身位置显示预警，0.3秒后以长6m×宽0.7m的光线依次横扫-45°至-15°、-15°至+15°、+15°至+45°的3个区段，每段0.4秒。每次横扫对每名敌人命中1次，造成相当于攻击力与法术强度中较高一方30%的光属性伤害（合计90%，上限100%）。此外消除现有的光晶，生成2个无法攻击的支援光晶（持续3秒），自身获得相当于攻击力与法术强度中较高一方38%（上限40%）的护盾，持续2秒。护盾不叠加。冷却12秒，光晶总计最多存在2个。",
                new[] { C("LightFractureSweeps",BossLightBalance.LightFractureSweepsValue,BossLightBalance.LightFractureSweepsCap), C("LightSupportShield",BossLightBalance.LightSupportShieldValue,BossLightBalance.LightSupportShieldCap,BossCoefficientKind.Shield) },
                LightBeam(BossEvent.Clock,"LightFractureSweeps",BossLightBalance.Stage6A0CooldownMillis,BossLightBalance.Stage6A0DelayMillis,BossLightBalance.Stage6A0RangeMilli,BossLightBalance.Stage6A0WidthMilli,BossLightBalance.Stage6A0LifetimeMillis,BossLightBalance.Stage6A0AngleMilli,BossLightBalance.Stage6A0Count),
                LightShield(BossEvent.Clock,"LightSupportShield",BossLightBalance.Stage6A1CooldownMillis),
